  "instructions": [
    "Blend the ginger, garlic, cilantro stems, some leaves, chili powder, and water into a rough paste.",
    "Brown the chicken pieces briefly in hot oil.",
    "Stir the aromatic paste into the chicken and cook it for one minute.",
    "Add the peanut butter, broth, and yogurt and bring the sauce to a gentle simmer.",
    "Cook until the chicken reaches 165°F and the sauce thickens, then fold in the remaining cilantro."
